`browser.evaluate` — I can query computed styles. This gives me the objective consistency data the reviewing skill wants: distinct font sizes, radii, shadows, padding, and whether labels are centered.

The tab currently on a390.html has an iframe; I need to evaluate inside the iframe. `frameID` param exists but I don't know the frame id. Maybe `evaluate` with script that accesses `document.querySelector('iframe').contentDocument` — same-origin, so allowed.

Let me run a script in the a390 tab that inspects `document.querySelector('iframe').contentDocument`.

