}
```
Careful: `.form-input-sm` sets 13px — on mobile bumping to 16 for inputs is right.

Hmm, will 16px break layouts? Filter bars etc. might get wider. Acceptable; better than zoom.

**Select arrow offset with 16px**: padding-left 32px fine.

