I'll add a separate `.form-input-sm { min-height: 0; }` rule before the media query, and add min-height:44px inside the media block after the font-size rule. Let me structure:

```
/* .form-input-sm is the desktop density variant: the 44px floor from the
   design system belongs to the default size, so keep the compact one short
   until the screen is small enough that touch sizing matters. */
.form-input-sm {
  min-height: 0;
}
```

And in the media block add:
```
  .form-input-sm {
